<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CV - Text Formatting</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Xisrav Aslonov</h1>
    <p><i>Student / Future Web Developer</i></p>

    <h2>Contact Information</h2>
    <p><b>Phone:</b> [Your phone number]</p>
    <p><b>Email:</b> [Your email address]</p>

    <h2>Profile</h2>
    <p>I am a <strong>motivated</strong> student interested in <em>web development</em> and computer science.</p>
    <p>My goal is to <u>become a skilled developer</u> and improve my practical programming abilities.</p>

    <h2>Achievement</h2>
    <p><mark>[Add an award, certificate or achievement]</mark></p>

    <h2>Education</h2>
    <p><b>Year:</b> [Start year] - [End year]</p>
    <p>I am a 1<sup>st</sup> year student. Example of a subscript: H<sub>2</sub>O.</p>

    <p><small>Last updated: November 2026</small></p>
</body>
</html>